00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.170
This is an ineffective way for us

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:15.340
to get to know each other.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.287
He kinda pointed me and said,

00:01:16.287 --> 00:01:17.357
"for example, Chris Cunningham,

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:19.210
"we don't really know each other."

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.670
And my point is, for all the students,

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:23.200
all the kids over there,

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.630
that the fearlessness
and ideas that are crazy,

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:28.690
those are the best ones!

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:29.670
Those are the best ones.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.240
So, I think that was
my kind of catalyst to

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:35.190
get to know Gary and kinda
watching what he's doing now.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.851
So, I'm not gonna do
the bio or his intro or

00:01:37.851 --> 00:01:38.970
I think what you guys know,

