who came from adversity,
you have no excuses,

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:58.110
'cause they didn't have the internet.

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:00.210
Bad news is what I tell them.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.940
Whatever bullshit or excuses
you're gonna come up with

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:04.870
aren't gonna be true 'cause
the internet doesn't care

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:06.230
where you came from,
what's your last name,

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:08.470
what your gender is and
what skin tone you have.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:11.900
It's an unbelievably open marketplace

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:13.120
for entrepreneurship.

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.070
The end.

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:16.077
So, what do I tell them?

00:22:16.077 --> 00:22:18.100
Excuses out the door.

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:19.070
- You got this.

00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:20.797
- You're not gonna be able to

00:22:20.797 --> 00:22:22.370
You have to understand why.

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:24.650
My big thing is if anybody's ever made it

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:25.580
with your circumstance,

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:27.860
if there's ever been a person who's had

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.430
two alcoholic parents,
lived in 13 foster homes,

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:33.610
and went on to succeed and have happiness,

00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:35.160
the excuse has been eliminated.

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:38.170
That's how I think about it.

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:39.800
- Perfect, thank you Gary.

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:41.670
We were gonna do one
more and I was gonna say,

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:44.883
under the age of 20 is
gonna get the privilege.

00:22:46.162 --> 00:22:48.401
(crosstalk)

00:22:48.401 --> 00:22:49.489
- We'll do both.
- We'll do both,

00:22:49.489 --> 00:22:50.322
we'll do both.

00:22:50.322 --> 00:22:51.160
- Yes, you first.

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:57.140
- In a society full of opportunities

00:22:57.140 --> 00:22:58.320
for young people, when do you know

00:22:58.320 --> 00:22:59.720
it's time to take your shot?

00:23:00.999 --> 00:23:04.490
- [Gary] First of all, it
depends on what your shot is.

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:06.640
Usually the way I think
about taking a shot is

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:09.360
if you're not negatively
affecting anybody around you

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.920
that you care for, it's
time to take your shot.

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:12.753
Right?

00:23:12.753 --> 00:23:14.923
So, I don't know how
you're defining your shot.

00:23:15.789 --> 00:23:20.040
I often give advice that is unpopular

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.590
around the current infrastructure.

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:24.860
I'm the biggest fan of
all time of education.

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:29.530
I'm the least fan of the way
education is packaged and sold.

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:30.363
Right?

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:33.833
The answer is now.

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:39.390
The only thing that stops
people from taking their shot

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:41.530
are something very black and white

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:43.560
and something extremely gray.

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:46.660
The gray part is other people's opinions.

00:23:46.660 --> 00:23:48.850
You're worried about
other people's opinions.

00:23:48.850 --> 00:23:49.770
The only other thing is

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:51.170
if you've defined your shot as

00:23:51.170 --> 00:23:52.200
